            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner, the case questions whether military appellate courts have jurisdiction under the All Writs Act to entertain coram nobis challenges to final court\u2011martial convictions."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "dfee6d22d9f1f5e78b067ccae1581c7d525e8182b53deb9937581ec94685df13",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-dfee6d22d9f1-0000-0001"
